# Working notes, kept on disk and out of the repository.
#
# These were tracked until v1.18.0, when the history was rewritten to remove
# them. The trigger was the decision to make this repository public:
# .planning/audits/ carries the open-findings backlog, including a security
# finding with its file:line — publishing that is handing out a map to a
# weakness that is still live in a shipped product. Working notes are also
# simply not documentation; what users need lives in docs/ and is published.
.planning/
docs/archive/
PROMPT_AUTO.md
PROMPT_FROZEN_DATASET.md
# Agent instructions: read from disk by the tool that needs them, not content
# this repository owes a reader. Stays local.
CLAUDE.md
